#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:5 2f763b30aaa3448f9427b3a320ace640
msgid "CRUISE Mode"
msgstr "Cruise 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:7 61232b50eb8343b191517c59bef9d0b0
msgid ""
"Cruise mode is a bit like :ref:`FLY BY WIRE_B (FBWB) <fbwb-mode>`, but it "
"has \"heading lock\". It is the ideal mode for longer distance FPV flight, "
"as you can point the plane at a distant object and it will accurately track "
"to that object, automatically controlling altitude, airspeed and heading."
msgstr ""
"Cruise 模式有点类似 :ref:`FLY BY WIRE_B（FBWB）<fbwb-mode>`，但具有「航向锁定」功能。它是长距离 FPV "
"飞行的理想模式，您可以将飞机指向远处的目标，它将精确跟踪该目标，自动控制高度、空速和航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:15 1c4399db2f284f8e8cd2d189c33ae098
msgid ""
"CRUISE mode is not suitable for flight close to the ground. The time "
"constants for height control in CRUISE mode are the ones from TECS, which "
"are quite slow. When you are close to the ground CRUISE mode does not give "
"you the agility needed in pitch control to avoid hitting the ground."
msgstr ""
"Cruise 模式不适合在靠近地面时飞行。Cruise 模式中高度控制的时间常数来自 TECS，响应较慢。在靠近地面时，Cruise "
"模式无法提供避免触地所需的俯仰控制敏捷性。"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:21 6a5b19653ec54476925dc2b1384bc3a7
msgid "The way it works is this:"
msgstr "其工作方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:23 6273bc464ef249038834650ceaa187ab
msgid ""
"if you have any aileron or rudder input then it flies just like :ref:`FBWB "
"<fbwb-mode>`. So it holds altitude until you use the elevator to change the "
"target altitude (at the ``FBWB_CLIMB_RATE`` rate) and it adjusts airspeed "
"based on throttle"
msgstr ""
"如果有任何副翼或方向舵输入，飞行方式与 :ref:`FBWB <fbwb-mode>` 完全相同。即保持高度直到您使用升降舵以 "
"``FBWB_CLIMB_RATE`` 的速率改变目标高度，并根据油门调整空速"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:27 5d3cbbd3cc164c108e1e12cef3870e61
msgid ""
"when you let go of the aileron and rudder sticks for more than 0.5 seconds "
"it sets an internal waypoint at your current location, and projects a target"
" waypoint one kilometre ahead (note that heading lock will only activate if "
"you have GPS lock, and have a ground speed of at least 3 m/s)"
msgstr ""
"当您松开副翼和方向舵摇杆超过 0.5 秒后，系统将在当前位置设置一个内部航点，并在前方一公里处投射一个目标航点（注意：航向锁定仅在 GPS "
"锁定且地速至少为 3 m/s 时才会激活）"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:32 adf06daa95f64cbc8c6e831aea29db91
msgid ""
"as it flies along it heads for the target waypoint, and constantly updates "
"that target to always be one kilometre ahead, leaving the previous waypoint "
"as the position that you centred the aileron and rudder sticks"
msgstr "飞行过程中朝目标航点飞行，并不断更新目标始终保持在前方一公里处，将之前的航点保留为您居中副翼和方向舵摇杆时的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:36 8cf1797387ba4522b0a6c9a7b2c9ba06
msgid ""
"as long as you don't touch the aileron or rudder, it will run the same "
"navigation system it uses for waypoints, including crabbing, cross-track "
"etc, so it will very accurately hold that ground course even in the face of "
"changing wind conditions"
msgstr ""
"只要您不触碰副翼或方向舵，系统将运行与航点导航相同的导航系统，包括侧风修正、横向偏差修正等，因此即使在风向变化的情况下也能非常精确地保持该地面航迹"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:41 dcb7387d44014b5ab84813e32a395095
msgid ""
"One of the nicer aspects of CRUISE mode is how it handles rudder. If you "
"give it some rudder then the roll controller will keep the wings level, but "
"the plane will yaw with the rudder. So you get a \"wings level\" turn, "
"allowing you to rotate your flight to point at whatever geographic feature "
"you want to head towards. Then when you let go of the rudder it will head "
"straight for that point."
msgstr ""
"Cruise "
"模式的一个优点是对方向舵的处理方式。给予方向舵输入时，横滚控制器会保持机翼水平，但飞机会随方向舵偏航。因此您可以进行「机翼水平」转弯，将飞行方向旋转至任何您想前往的地理目标。然后松开方向舵时，飞机将直接飞向该点。"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:48 bf8003b32453482ca04189477f0271aa
msgid ""
"Note that you can configure CRUISE mode to do terrain following on "
"autopilots with microSD storage available. See the :ref:`terrain following "
"documentation <common-terrain-following>`."
msgstr ""
"请注意，您可以将 Cruise 模式配置为在具有 microSD 存储的飞控上进行地形跟随飞行。请参阅 :ref:`地形跟随文档 <common-"
"terrain-following>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/cruise-mode.rst:54 e874fcedcaa641f9b16a6454793bc53c
msgid ""
"Make sure you only fly FPV if it is allowed by your country's flight and "
"airspace control rules. Many countries do not allow non-line-of-sight flight"
" without a special operating license."
msgstr "请确保仅在您所在国家的飞行及空域管制规定允许的情况下进行 FPV 飞行。许多国家在没有特别运营许可的情况下不允许超视距飞行。"

